<!--
    The mark: a map pin with a spark cut out of it. The two things this app is made of - a
    place, and the story that lights up when you reach it - in one shape.

    The spark is a hole rather than a second colour, so the mark is a single path: it survives
    the monochrome layer a themed-icon launcher asks for, and it stays legible at 48dp where a
    two-colour detail would silt up. Drawn inside the centre 72dp that every adaptive icon
    shape is guaranteed to show.
-->
